pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Azzilon%20Castle\">Azzilon Castle</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Azzilon%20Catacombs\">Azzilon Catacombs</a></li></ul></div></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/fiend-slayer-outfits-quest\">Fiend Slayer Outfits Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/no-rest-for-the-wicked-quest\">No Rest for the Wicked Quest</a></li></ul></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">14.10.4e0c16<br/>November 25, 2024<br/>Winter Update 2024</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Locations <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p><b>Azzilon</b> is an ancient fortress isle long forgotten by the world. Once a vibrant stronghold where the forces of good and evil clashed, it fell into ruin after a catastrophic event that left the region devastated. Since then, it has remained shrouded in silence and sorrow, abandoned for generations.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h2>\n<p>In its prime, Azzilon stood as a battleground of divine significance, its walls bearing witness to epic conflicts fought in the names of the gods. Following its tragic downfall, a deep gloom settled over the war-ravaged fortifications. Over time, the island was consumed by neglect, its once-glorious structures buried beneath dust and decay.\n</p><p>For millennia, Azzilon remained untouched. Whether due to fate or the lingering presence of a dark influence, no explorers or looters dared to set foot upon its shores.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Present_Day\">Present Day</span></h2>\n<p>In recent times, Azzilon has once again become the focus of dark ambitions. Twisted forces have begun to stir within its depths, driven by forbidden rituals and sinister designs. Through unholy means, long-dead entities have been reawakened, now roaming the abandoned corridors in search of prey.\n</p><p>What was once an uninviting ruin has transformed into a corrupted and hostile environment. The air is thick with despair, and shifting shadows along the crumbling walls hint at the horrors that now inhabit the fortress.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Exploration\">Exploration</span></h2>\n<p>Despite its dangers, Azzilon holds a certain allure for brave adventurers. Its treacherous terrain and cursed relics offer both great risk and potential reward. Those who dare to explore its depths may uncover valuable treasures and long-forgotten secrets.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-NPCs\">NPCs</span></h2>\n<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold;\"><span id=\"w-Azzilon_NPCs_.284_NPCs.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Azzilon_NPCs_(4_NPCs)\">Azzilon NPCs (4 NPCs)</span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>Job\n</th>\n<th>Buy/Sell\n</th>\n<th>Location\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\"><a href=\"#/wiki/A%20Vision%20of%20the%20Past\">A Vision of the Past</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"npc-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/A%20Vision%20of%20the%20Past\"><img alt=\"A Vision of the Past\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/